    "help": "Show ffprobe status or configure a custom path. ffprobe is used for audio analysis in transcribe and debug commands.\n\nExamples:\n  dg ffprobe\n  dg ffprobe --path /opt/homebrew/bin/ffprobe\n  dg ffprobe --path $(which ffprobe)\n  dg ffprobe --reset\n\n\nFor agents, use --agent-friendly.",
